   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "References",
     "texto": [
      "**den/det/de** can refer back to nouns; **dette** can sum up a whole sentence or idea. Look for the nearest antecedent that agrees in gender and number, and confirm the meaning."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Logic between sentences",
     "texto": [
      "**derfor** introduces a consequence; **alligevel** marks an unexpected result; **desuden** adds an argument; **selvom** presents a concession. The connector guides you, but read the content too."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
